  },
  {
    "knowledge_id": "math_10_ch4_s3_002",
    "basic": {
      "name": "常用对数与自然对数",
      "type": "definition",
      "subject": "数学",
      "stage": "高中",
      "grade": "必修第一册",
      "level": "knowledge"
    },
    "tree": {
      "parent_id": null,
      "path": []
    },
    "concept": {
      "source_text": "常用对数（common logarithm）：以 10 为底的对数，log₁₀ N 记为 lg N。自然对数（natural logarithm）：以无理数 e = 2.71828… 为底的对数，log_e N 记为 ln N。在科技、经济和社会生活中广泛使用自然对数。",
      "level": "knowledge"
    },
    "relations": {
      "reference": [],
      "related": [
        "math_10_ch4_s3_001",
        "math_10_ch4_s3_011",
        "math_10_ch4_s1_011"
      ]
    },
    "importance": {
      "curriculum_weight": 3,
      "exam_frequency": 3
    }
  },
  {
    "knowledge_id": "math_10_ch4_s3_003",
    "basic": {
      "name": "指数与对数的互化关系",
      "type": "property",
      "subject": "数学",
      "stage": "高中",
      "grade": "必修第一册",
      "level": "knowledge"
    },
    "tree": {
      "parent_id": null,
      "path": []
    },
    "concept": {
      "source_text": "当 a > 0，a ≠ 1 时，aˣ = N ⇔ x = log_a N。这是对数与指数的核心关系式：指数式 aˣ = N 和对数式 x = log_a N 是同一关系的两种等价表示形式。利用此关系可以在指数式和对数式之间自由转换。",
      "level": "knowledge"
    },
    "relations": {
      "reference": [],
      "related": [
        "math_10_ch4_s3_001",
        "math_10_ch4_s3_004",
        "math_10_ch4_s3_006",
        "math_10_ch4_s1_001",
        "math_10_ch4_s1_012"
      ]
    },
    "importance": {
      "curriculum_weight": 4,
      "exam_frequency": 4
    }
  },
  {
    "knowledge_id": "math_10_ch4_s3_004",
    "basic": {
      "name": "对数的基本性质（特殊值与存在条件）",
      "type": "property",
      "subject": "数学",
      "stage": "高中",
      "grade": "必修第一册",
      "level": "knowledge"
    },
    "tree": {
      "parent_id": null,
      "path": []
    },
    "concept": {
      "source_text": "根据指数与对数的互化关系，可得三条基本结论：① 负数和 0 没有对数（因为 aˣ > 0 恒成立，真数 N 必须为正）；② log_a 1 = 0（因为 a⁰ = 1）；③ log_a a = 1（因为 a¹ = a）。这三条性质是对数定义的自然推论，也是对数的运算基础。",
      "level": "knowledge"
    },
    "relations": {
      "reference": [],
      "related": [
        "math_10_ch4_s3_001",
        "math_10_ch4_s3_003",
        "math_10_ch4_s3_007"
      ]
    },
    "importance": {
      "curriculum_weight": 4,
      "exam_frequency": 4
    }
  },
  {
    "knowledge_id": "math_10_ch4_s3_005",
    "basic": {
      "name": "指数式与对数式的互化方法",
      "type": "method",
      "subject": "数学",
      "stage": "高中",
      "grade": "必修第一册",
      "level": "knowledge"
    },
    "tree": {
      "parent_id": null,
      "path": []
    },
    "concept": {
      "source_text": "利用 aˣ = N ⇔ x = log_a N 在指数式和对数式之间进行转换。指数式化对数式时：底数 a 不变成为对数的底数，幂 N 变成真数，指数 x 变成对数的值。对数式化指数式时：底数 a 不变，对数的值 x 成为指数，真数 N 成为幂的值。",
      "level": "knowledge"
    },
    "relations": {
      "reference": [],
